[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4921.189, "timestamp": "01:22:01", "text": "你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4924.629, "timestamp": "01:22:04", "text": "是的。是的。是的。我可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4926.31, "timestamp": "01:22:06", "text": "如果需要解释，就说“是”。告诉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4927.669, "timestamp": "01:22:07", "text": "你需要我解释一下哪个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4928.87, "timestamp": "01:22:08", "text": "在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4933.189, "timestamp": "01:22:13", "text": "呃，至宝有什么作用？ Arcana 是你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4935.83, "timestamp": "01:22:15", "text": "关于魔法的知识"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4937.83, "timestamp": "01:22:17", "text": "就像神奇的东西吸引着人们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4940.31, "timestamp": "01:22:20", "text": "咒语、魔法物品以及其他类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4949.99, "timestamp": "01:22:29", "text": "那么，医学就是用来治病的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4953.59, "timestamp": "01:22:33", "text": "不，医学更像是诊断。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4955.27, "timestamp": "01:22:35", "text": "疾病。疗愈就像另一种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4958.149, "timestamp": "01:22:38", "text": "完全是另一回事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4960.229, "timestamp": "01:22:40", "text": "但药物确实能帮助你解决诸如此类的问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4961.75, "timestamp": "01:22:41", "text": "比如，如果有人流血了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4963.669, "timestamp": "01:22:43", "text": "即使他们奄奄一息，你也可以对他们进行急救。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4965.51, "timestamp": "01:22:45", "text": "它并不能真正治愈它们，但它能保留它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4969.43, "timestamp": "01:22:49", "text": "身体稳定，不会突然死亡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4971.51, "timestamp": "01:22:51", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4973.51, "timestamp": "01:22:53", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4975.83, "timestamp": "01:22:55", "text": "感知就像是检测事物一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4976.55, "timestamp": "01:22:56", "text": "正确的？危险。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4979.75, "timestamp": "01:22:59", "text": "是的